<title>PHILIPPINES: Itogon-Suyoc Q3 net loss 19.544 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Itogon-Suyoc Q3 net loss 19.544 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Itogon-Suyoc Mines Inc posted a net loss of 19.544 million pesos in the third quarter of the year, documents submitted to the Securities and Exchange Commission on Friday showed.</p>
<p>Gross revenues from the sale of its gold and silver totalled 13.538 million pesos, while operating costs and expenses amounted to 13.295 million pesos.</p>
<p>Comparative figures were not immediately available.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
